From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 19:09:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: delete sign-in + cloud_api_client stub (GAP-7,
 type-only residual)

Deletes the boot authenticate() path, its two call sites, the SignIn action
handler, and the sign_in_with_optional_connect no-op stub (callerless after the
above). cloud_api_client is not fully deletable: it stays as a type-only crate
for kept consumers (client, language_models) - CloudApiClient no-op handle,
ClientApiError, LlmApiToken, and re-exported cloud_api_types enums. The residual
is documented symbol-by-symbol at the top of cloud_api_client.rs. No method
contacts a remote service. Closes GAP-7.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/client/src/client.rs                   | 23 +-----------------
 .../cloud_api_client/src/cloud_api_client.rs  | 22 +++++++++++++++++
 crates/zed/src/main.rs                        | 24 -------------------
 3 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 46 deletions(-)

